{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/extras/astrovoids_ABOUT_THIS_GAME_.gif?t=1746396726\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AstroVoids is a fast-paced space roguelike where you'll face relentless hordes of enemies trying to destroy you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/extras/astrovoids_gif_2_.gif?t=1746396726\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each wave, choose a new upgrade and discover how powerful your build can become!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/extras/astrovoids_gif_1_.gif?t=1746396726\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your ship indestructible and dominate the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your best build and find out how far you can go in the vacuum of space!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603510?t=1746396726","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/e74d36d0f84fa279c45201d2316ec23b1ca511e4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746396726","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/353baa45f6bd055e705ffc02970292dc7f4dac49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746396726","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603510/353baa45f6bd055e705ffc02970292dc7f4dac49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746396726","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store